# K1a bootability refinement for munch memory diagnostics.
#
# Merge after munch-mm-diag.config:
#   make O=out vendor/munch_defconfig munch-mm-diag.config munch-mm-diag-k1a.config
#
# The RAM-only K1 image reset before Android completed boot, while the same
# verified boot image with the daily mrelease kernel booted. DEBUG_LIST is a
# global list-invariant checker; it is useful for the original page->lru
# corruption, but it can also turn unrelated vendor list misuse during boot
# into a fatal failure. K1a leaves the targeted VM checks, page ownership and
# MM tracepoint support intact, but removes that global tripwire.

# CONFIG_DEBUG_LIST is not set
